{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "59f8ffd0ea6cecda13fd0ca7442f087419a39058fc6a775ed6703eaf8fedaf15", "ja": "かけがえのない時間", "zh": "不可替代的时光", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e74252ebe47e0475f361def80383687ac5e3e9d6bde957b8292ad980a6446d97", "ja": "次のお悩みは、女子高生からの恋愛相談。\n美也とエレナも悩むが、どんな結果になって\nも、思いは伝えた方がいいとの結論に。\nやがてお悩み相談が終わると、お待ちかね、\nふたりのライブが始まるのだった。", "zh": "下一个烦恼，是一名女高中生前来咨询恋爱问题。\n美也和艾蕾娜也为此烦恼，但最后得出的结论是，\n无论结果如何，还是应该把心意传达出去。\n烦恼咨询结束后，万众期待的两人演唱会终于开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1000_018ele", "source_sha256": "3e1bac46d5b93d62a81b7598a303b24e59f332cd950e1c0d54b79380e7bb5d61", "ja": "次のお悩みは、青春ネーム「リナリア」さん。\n高校2年生、17歳の女の子からだヨ！", "zh": "接下来的烦恼咨询，来自青春昵称“莉娜莉亚”。\n是一位高中2年级、17岁的女孩子哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "740a287ab1c43e3cb7c8f71d1655d0449c4e1c8601c555a5246e837d89276d06", "ja": "おお～、私たちと同い年ですね～。\nリナリアさん、お便りありがとうございます～♪", "zh": "哇～和我们同岁呢～。\n莉娜莉亚，谢谢你的来信～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "401be3a1abc6200d0f83389dfa9857795ec073feb6273dda6abd509140c7fcde", "ja": "「美也さん、エレナさん。\nおふたりの意見を聞きたいので、相談させてください」", "zh": "“美也、艾莲娜。\n我想听听你们两个人的意见，所以来向你们咨询”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "79244350474b0c6d3e02e3044f58688190e84375ced336028eafdfb0108649b4", "ja": "「私には今、好きな人がいます。相手は1つ上の先輩。\nでも最近、その先輩に恋人がいることを知りました」", "zh": "“我现在有喜欢的人。对方是比我大1岁的前辈。\n但我最近得知，那位前辈已经有交往对象了。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "0c6b1b317c2dc53262d64f2aa315ba859f3321ed5faa13e847debcc1e7bda735", "ja": "「叶わない恋だとわかっていても、あきらめることが\nできません。私はどうすればいいでしょうか？」", "zh": "「明明知道这是一段不会有结果的恋情，却还是\n无法放弃。请问我该怎么做才好呢？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "7a3ae92a01d17342f6b871b6782f2d0ac97281db259681738d94d8760b822639", "ja": "む～……なかなか難しいお悩みですな～。", "zh": "唔～……真是个挺难办的烦恼呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "7939c0cd73a663bc2745dc839eb440d2b83ee5819d706b213e832fcae9bdc38c", "ja": "苦しい恋って感じだネ……。\nうーん……ミヤなら、こんな時どうする？", "zh": "感觉是段艰难的恋情呢……。\n嗯……如果是美也，这种时候会怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "6afedb6622adf1d66585f43fd81e4d84b0b0b2488450e8a9628ba9488f0b400f", "ja": "そうですね～……。\nもし私が、同じ立場だったら……。", "zh": "是这样呢～……\n如果是我，处在同样的立场上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "9811d33ab26a1641c9c0dc5c5ed9651ee2dd903e86b5f7fa562b67c2e6f619c4", "ja": "相手の人には、好きな人がいるので。相手の\n気持ちを変えることは、難しいと思いますけど……。", "zh": "因为对方已经有喜欢的人了。想要改变对方的心意，我觉得很难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "42679f1ed773ad5dc70ef2128cd5cf3aedf65b3397da4766c721eba09369e72d", "ja": "それとは別に、自分の思いは、ちゃんと伝えるかも\nしれませんね～。前に進むためにも……。", "zh": "除此之外，也许我会好好传达自己的心意吧～为了向前迈进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "e09c217beb2212c6e8481ce137318040d0e69cf6a3a56c29157bfb9390dd2abe", "ja": "うん……ワタシも、それがいいと思うナ。\nどんな結果になったとしても……。", "zh": "嗯……我也觉得那样很好呢。\n无论结果会变成怎样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "5ad63abdd7be3adee5e7d978fe91caf7eb856333ed7594fc7c1d8d4ea5ad477d", "ja": "はい～。うまくいかないことがあっても、それも\nいつかきっと、大切な思い出になると信じますよ～。", "zh": "是呀～我相信，即使有不顺利的时候，那也一定会在某一天成为珍贵的回忆哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "43713a86ba309eef7c6651c0bc6af72def2675809188298579d891321f875710", "ja": "なんか青春って感じだネ。\n胸がキュンってするヨ……。", "zh": "总觉得很有青春的感觉呢。\n心里怦怦直跳的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "310895a64ce2570e75a8d9fcc920b171ef551088dd13cb2ddde507d13e499587", "ja": "そうですね～。\nいいことばかりではないからこそ……", "zh": "是啊～  \n正因为青春并不总是一帆风顺……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "8472a0633b39bbc048c606c5f042ce6630ec22610e047f363e5096ae16fe5c53", "ja": "青春のひとときは、\nかけがえのない時間になるんでしょうな～。", "zh": "青春中的一段时光，会成为无可替代的珍贵时光吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "074fe258a7baf4707f48e5a691c7b36392433dbd5dbcd88dea7d3095a9d1428e", "ja": "リナリアさんにとって、いい思い出になるよう、\nワタシたちも応援してるからネ！", "zh": "为了让这成为リナリア的美好回忆，我们也会为你加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "72e274a64b9abfcb881a9a486f12e1a9eb9318768710c21a74441bf4e0f43191", "ja": "以上、Cleaskyの青春お悩み相談でした～。\n次は、私たちの歌を聴いてもらう時間ですよ～。", "zh": "以上就是Cleasky的青春烦恼咨询啦～  \n接下来到了请大家聆听我们歌曲的时间哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "88a633ec5864f1767af6d6dda876f4c3e5904987d760470a7f381181bccf268a", "ja": "ワタシたちの曲も、そんな大切な\n思い出について歌った曲だヨ。みんな、覚えてる？", "zh": "我们的歌也是歌唱那些珍贵回忆的歌曲哦。大家还记得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1018_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0229_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0229_story_04_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "2fe2221a2fc8cedb7c5b8688d33adaf21b22b089c7f7700c5a436dbb349a2bab", "ja": "それでは、聴いてください……。", "zh": "那么，请欣赏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
